-- Measure 9.1 fixtures.
`ind 9.1 all done` MEANS `my incident identification` WITH
    `I consider the exemplary methods in Measure 3.5`                   IS TRUE
    `I review other sources such as police and media reports, social media, research papers and incident databases` IS TRUE
    `direct reporting channels are available`                           IS TRUE
    `I inform third parties of the direct reporting channels`           IS TRUE

`ind 9.1 no review of other sources` MEANS `my incident identification` WITH
    `I consider the exemplary methods in Measure 3.5`                   IS TRUE
    `I review other sources such as police and media reports, social media, research papers and incident databases` IS FALSE
    `direct reporting channels are available`                           IS TRUE
    `I inform third parties of the direct reporting channels`           IS TRUE

`ind 9.1 channels not passed on` MEANS `my incident identification` WITH
    `I consider the exemplary methods in Measure 3.5`                   IS TRUE
    `I review other sources such as police and media reports, social media, research papers and incident databases` IS TRUE
    `direct reporting channels are available`                           IS TRUE
    `I inform third parties of the direct reporting channels`           IS FALSE

`ind 9.1 Measure 3.5 not considered` MEANS `my incident identification` WITH
    `I consider the exemplary methods in Measure 3.5`                   IS FALSE
    `I review other sources such as police and media reports, social media, research papers and incident databases` IS TRUE
    `direct reporting channels are available`                           IS TRUE
    `I inform third parties of the direct reporting channels`           IS TRUE

