`ind items 1 to 7` MEANS LIST `item 1, start and end dates`, `item 2, resulting harm and victims`, `item 3, chain of events`, `item 4, model involved`, `item 5, material on the model's involvement`, `item 6, what I intend to do or have done`, `item 7, what I recommend the authorities do`
