#ASSERT `by when must I make my initial report` FALSE TRUE `ind led` `ind led` `ind led` `ind led` `ind led` `ind led` `ind led` (YMD 2026 3 10) FALSE EQUALS `no initial report is due, because the Chapter does not bind me`
