#ASSERT `when is my next intermediate report due` FALSE TRUE (JUST (YMD 2026 3 10)) NOTHING TRUE NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS `no intermediate report is due, because the Chapter does not bind me`
#ASSERT `when is my final report due` FALSE TRUE TRUE (JUST (YMD 2026 11 1)) (JUST (YMD 2026 11 1)) EQUALS `no final report is due, because the Chapter does not bind me`
#ASSERT `how long must I keep the records` FALSE TRUE (YMD 2026 3 10) (YMD 2026 1 5) NOTHING EQUALS `no retention duty, because the Chapter does not bind me`
#ASSERT `may I report a similar incident with the first` FALSE TRUE TRUE (YMD 2026 3 11) (YMD 2026 3 12) NOTHING EQUALS `may I report a later similar incident with the first` OF FALSE, FALSE

